# "o" (of, from) links a day-of-month to its month ("y 3ydd o
# Orffennaf") and triggers SOFT mutation on the month name that follows,
# which is why every mutable month ships its mutated surface.  Attested in
# running text on cy.wikipedia.org.  Source: en.wiktionary.org,
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/o.
o
